{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.2.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "tempo",
      "name": "Tempo",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "efe-msw-iterate",
  "title": "EFE Meta-Swarm \u2014 Iterate Performance",
  "description": "Iterate latency, throughput, convergence + stop-reason distribution. Use during canary roll-out to compare manifest versions.",
  "tags": [
    "efe",
    "meta-swarm",
    "pr19",
    "iterate"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Manifest reloads",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#5794F2",
        "expr": "changes(efe_meta_swarm_reload_gen{cluster=~\"$cluster\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m]) > 0",
        "tagKeys": "trigger",
        "titleFormat": "Reload (gen={{value}})"
      },
      {
        "name": "Deployments",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#73BF69",
        "expr": "changes(efe_meta_swarm_build_info{cluster=~\"$cluster\", env=~\"$env\"}[5m]) > 0",
        "tagKeys": "version,git_sha",
        "titleFormat": "Deploy {{git_sha}}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "prometheus_ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_build_info, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Environment",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_build_info{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "manifest_version",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Manifest version",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}, manifest_version)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "runbook_base",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
        "current": {
          "text": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
          "value": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "skipUrlSync": true,
        "label": "runbook base URL"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Iterate p50 / p95 / p99 \u2014 by manifest version",
      "description": "Per-manifest-version latency tracking. During a canary roll-out, two series should appear ; the canary's curve must remain within 10 % of the stable curve.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (manifest_version, le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\",manifest_version=~\"$manifest_version\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 / {{manifest_version}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "efe_msw:iterate_duration:p95_5m{manifest_version=~\"$manifest_version\"}",
          "legendFormat": "p95 / {{manifest_version}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "efe_msw:iterate_duration:p99_5m{manifest_version=~\"$manifest_version\"}",
          "legendFormat": "p99 / {{manifest_version}}",
          "refId": "C",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Iterate throughput by result (stacked)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (result) (efe_msw:iterate_total:rate5m)",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ok"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "deadline"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Iterate inflight",
      "description": "Saturation indicator. Persistent >= controller-replica count suggests router stickiness or hot-spotting.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_inflight{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "inflight (sum)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_inflight{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"})",
          "legendFormat": "inflight (max replica)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Stop-reason distribution (last 1h)",
      "description": "Closed taxonomy (STABILITY_CONTRACT v1.1) : converged / max_iters_reached / cancelled / error / participant_down / unknown.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (failure_reason) (increase(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{failure_reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "pieType": "pie",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Iteration count distribution",
      "description": "How many inner iterations each iterate call takes. Drift to higher buckets \u21d2 algorithm needs more rounds to converge.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_iterations_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Spectral"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "show": true,
          "yHistogram": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Convergence error distribution",
      "description": "Final residual when iterate terminates. Long tail \u21d2 algorithm struggles ; bimodal \u21d2 two distinct convergence regimes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_convergence_error_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Viridis"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Iterate failures by failure_reason",
      "description": "Stacked failure-rate timeseries. Drives the primary alert A1 diagnosis path.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (failure_reason) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_total{result=\"error\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{failure_reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 with exemplars (click dot \u2192 Tempo)",
      "description": "Slow-iterate exemplars carry trace_id. PR #18 wires exemplars at the histogram observation site ; clicking opens the offending trace in Tempo (D9).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 (overall)",
          "refId": "A",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Iterate latency heatmap (all manifest versions)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Turbo"
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Drill-down references",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Pivot from this dashboard** :\n- failure_reason = `safety_violation` \u2192 [D7 Safety](/d/efe-msw-safety)\n- failure_reason = `participant_down` \u2192 [D3 Participant](/d/efe-msw-participant)\n- failure_reason = `deadline_exceeded` \u2192 [D8 Runtime](/d/efe-msw-runtime)\n- failure_reason = `internal` \u2192 [D9 Trace explorer](/d/efe-msw-traces)\n\n**Recording rules consumed** : `efe_msw:iterate_total:rate5m` \u00b7 `efe_msw:iterate_duration:p95_5m` \u00b7 `efe_msw:iterate_duration:p99_5m`\n\n**Linked alerts** : [A1 IterateFailureRateHigh](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW1.md) \u00b7 [A2 IterateLatencyP99Critical](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW2.md) \u00b7 [A9 SLOBudgetBurnFast14x](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW9.md)\n"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    }
  ]
}